OL,3,GNEWSAFlood-damaged country park bridge
OL,4,Areopens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bridge, replacing one damaged in
OL,7,Fwinter floods, has opened in a park in
OL,8,FLeicestershire.
OL,10,FThe wooden footbridge in Melton Country
OL,11,FPark, which crosses Scalford Brook near
OL,12,Fthe stepping stones, was partially
OL,13,Fsubmerged in January 2025.
OL,15,FThe new bridge has been built wider to
OL,16,Fallow for wheelchairs and pushchairs,
OL,17,Falong with strengthened foundations and
OL,18,Fanti-slip decking.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
